          "text": "Yangena phakathi kwempi yabaseGibithe nempi yakwa-Israyeli; futhi laliyifu nobumnyama kubo, kodwa lalibakhanyisela ebusuku, ukuze omunye angafiki komunye ubusuku bonke.",
