        {
          "text": "Ase ekhumula amasondo ezinqola zawo, awagibelisa, kangangokuthi abaseGibithe bathi: “Masibaleke phambi kuka-Israyeli; ngoba uJehova uyabalwela emelene labaseGibhithe.",
