        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yasisithi kuMozisi: Yelula isandla sakho phezu kolwandle, ukuze amanzi abuyele phezu kwabaseGibhithe, phezu kwezinqola zabo laphezu kwabagadi bawo bamabhiza.",
